  "fixed": [
    "Planning returns bounded evidence/range read errors to the model while preserving parser/integrity guards, cancellation, read-only scope and the twelve-call bound.",
    "Planning preserves fixed-cell action targets instead of inventing selected-row workflows; action programs validate existing numeric state as well as arguments.",
    "Conflicting action-write and formula-output declarations identify exact conflicting cells and the repair contract without weakening authority.",
    "Precise Excel cell-address errors and hidden derived outputs prevent misleading undefined/NaN repairs.",
    "Request-scoped verified calculation drafts survive UI repair; failed/replaced comparisons invalidate them and publication rechecks them.",
    "Repair context keeps the latest candidate and one strictly better partial calculation from the same conversion; obsolete verified drafts never confer authority, and all retry limits remain enforced.",
    "Blank and invalid secondary operands, error precedence and decimal halfway rounding are exercised against independent originals plus held-out saved edits.",
    "Native-supported formulas are reused without contradictory guide or build-request instructions; feedback uses neutral styling unless an explicit reactive outcome state is provided.",
    "Native PMT supports signed constant-period payments, future balance and timing, with decimal zero-rate arithmetic and bounded stable nonzero-rate evaluation; original-cache qualification remains mandatory.",
    "Mismatched comparisons count as failed attempts; unchanged bad programs cannot loop as successful progress.",
    "Independent reviewers must reproduce an interface defect before asking for a revision; passing or invalid probes cannot force false repairs.",
    "Compile-only QuickJS preflight reports exact syntax location and bounded token context without executing or rewriting source.",
    "Deterministic calendar.addDays provides Gregorian date arithmetic without exposing clock, timezone or Date constructor.",
    "A successful checked Excel save immediately finishes the request instead of letting the model repeat a consumed build.",
    "Native SDK rejects unsupported event handlers. Native rows are vertically centered and short tables forward vertical scrolling to the form.",
    "Generic authoring guidance preserves original blank/text/error/rounding semantics and fully validates numeric action arguments.",
    "Independent harness fixes preserve exact input text, compare canonical numeric outputs correctly, update all Loan input cells and locate one unambiguous shipment control."
